    description: Concept DOI, resolving to the latest version
repository-code: "https://github.com/manishthatte/thatteOS"
url: "https://www.manitlab.org"
abstract: >-
  A microkernel operating system written entirely in ManiT, a
  systems language whose native number system is balanced
  ternary. Privilege is one trit deep, virtual memory uses
  trit-trie page tables, and the kernel schedules a
  photonic-ternary fabric the way a conventional kernel
  schedules a processor.
keywords:
  - balanced ternary
  - operating system
  - microkernel
  - capability security
  - ManiT
